      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seems that the SDK changes avatar audio to fully 3D upon upload. This completely cuts out the right channel. You can have both channels if the audio is forced to mono in the import settings. Also worth noting is that the sdk doesn't reduce volume if its under a dynamic bone transform. I haven't been able to test attenuation yet.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
